 ut sicut de beátae Teré-tónis erudiámur afféctu. Per Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-ef8f5009-0790-4996-8663-fd8d54c39208" facs="#m-07fa9cde-347c-46b7-a508-981c3b711a57" label="lyrics-like">siae Vírginis tuae festivitá̂te gau¬ minum.</l><l xml:id="m-152454e7-7203-47b7-bca1-d30651f80c52" facs="#m-79214b6d-76d7-4808-b3df-5a7534c16469" label="lyrics-like">démus; ita caeléstis ejus doctrinae</l><l xml:id="m-dd7bcd70-fb0b-40fe-8dd7-52eee4ef9aec" facs="#m-9619f0ea-3b93-4e2a-8be9-153fba78c3da" label="ambiguous">Saint Hedwig, Widow.</l><l xml:id="m-dbddfb2a-0822-4ee1-9a92-f419074ce7eb" facs="#m-8b0c915d-869d-4fd1-a997-cb79c5c2ec7b" label="ambiguous">16.</l><l xml:id="m-5dcc883d-b8b3-442c-8905-21d007cdecd8" facs="#m-d2404fbb-b1b6-4627-bc10-689daed0da2f" label="ambiguous">Semi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-d0aba1c7-e67f-4a8a-9268-93ee3ff1ced6" facs="#m-51722683-08d0-47ad-8970-9e7403db1ea5" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-8a925a21-173f-42fd-9e4d-6e8eba398c3f" facs="#m-9d47a63b-4481-4234-b0da-72c8885a3546" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátam Hedwigem a túras mundi calcare delicias, * et in</l><l xml:id="m-72433444-6ab8-468c-8313-e73d7dd5c33d" facs="#m-63ad3e36-1602-46a0-868e-aa4f423b1959" label="lyrics-like">O saéculi pompa ad húmilem l ampléxu tuae crucis ómnia nobis</l><l xml:id="m-d297040f-16bd-461a-a68f-dee58d82f3d6" facs="#m-03905e52-97b3-48af-9fc6-cfa321955cc7" label="lyrics-like">tuae crucis sequélam toto corde l adversántia superáre: Qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-1ed6b5a4-2bff-47d7-a318-12d1a2f7cbd9" facs="#m-00f6cd5e-2ba3-46d6-b5ea-c5dbf63e817f" label="lyrics-like">transire docuísti :t concéde; ut ejus regnas cum Deo Patre, in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-9f150b17-f2d6-43e6-b3f6-9c6291a933ae" facs="#m-a6cc927e-9949-4f6c-98f7-eedc0527048e" label="lyrics-like">méritis et exémplo discámus peri-Spiritus Sancti, Deus.</l><l xml:id="m-4fa7669e-1cfe-45c4-ad05-f192f2b86129" facs="#m-5f03c29e-384e-4720-a471-7c9b0a9a939c" label="lyrics-like">Secret. Accépta tibi si